    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Riley Anderson is a young girl from America. There are five "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "emotions",
            "ref": "v-emotion"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in her head."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "So happy to meet you all! I’m "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Joy",
            "zh": "乐乐"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and I’m full of joy! I want Riley to be happy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I’m "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Fear",
            "zh": "怕怕"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I’m not "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "brave",
            "ref": "v-brave"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I think everything is "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "dangerous",
            "ref": "v-dangerous"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But don’t "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "look down on",
            "zh": "小看"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " me. I can keep Riley safe."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It’s me, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Disgust",
            "zh": "厌厌"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I have to say: the world is not good at all! I must "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "keep Riley away from",
            "ref": "v-keep-away"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " those bad boys."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I’m "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Sadness",
            "zh": "忧忧"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I’m not tall, and I’m sad. I’m not thin, and I’m sad. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Leave me alone",
            "zh": "不管"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and let me "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cry",
            "ref": "v-cry"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for a while."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I’m "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Anger",
            "zh": "怒怒"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I often get angry. Be careful, kids!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "note",
        "title": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Did you know?"
          }
        ],
        "content": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "动画电影《头脑特工队》("
            },
            {
              "t": "em",
              "v": "Inside Out"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ")中，小女孩莱莉因父亲工作变动而搬家。正要适应新环境时，脑海里掌管快乐与忧伤的乐乐、忧忧意外走失。大脑总部里只剩怒怒、怕怕、厌厌留守，原本乐观的莱莉因此变得消极敏感。乐乐和忧忧必须穿越复杂的脑海世界赶回总部，帮莱莉重新找回快乐。"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    ]
